[00:11.849]As I walk through the valley of the shadow of death
{"当我行过死荫的幽谷"}
[00:14.756]I take a look at my life and realize there's nothin' left
{"审视人生发现一无所有"}
[00:18.043]'Cause I've been blastin' and laughin' so long, that
{"因我狂笑放纵太久"}
[00:21.148]Even my momma thinks that my mind is gone
{"连母亲都认为我已疯癫"}
[00:23.641]But I ain't never crossed a man that didn't deserve it
{"但我从不伤害无辜之人"}
[00:26.827]Me be treated like a punk, you know that's unheard of
{"若被当作废物 这绝无可能"}
[00:30.138]You better watch how you talkin' and where you walkin'
{"你最好注意言行举止"}
[00:32.954]Or you and your homies might be lined in chalk
{"否则你们将粉笔描边躺平"}
[00:35.958]I really hate to trip, but I gotta loc
{"本不愿惹事 但必须出手"}
[00:38.797]As they croak, I see myself in the pistol smoke
{"看他们倒下 我在硝烟中照见自己"}
[00:41.757]Fool, I'm the kinda G the little homies wanna be like
{"听着 我是小弟们想成为的那种狠角色"}
[00:44.933]On my knees in the night, sayin' prayers in the streetlight
{"深夜跪在街灯下祷告"}
[00:48.170]
[00:48.331]They've been spendin' most their lives livin' in the gangsta's paradise
{"他们大半生都活在匪帮天堂里"}
[00:54.358]They've been spendin' most their lives livin' in the gangsta's paradise
{"他们大半生都活在匪帮天堂里"}
[01:00.295]We keep spendin' most our lives livin' in the gangsta's paradise
{"我们大半生都活在匪帮天堂里"}
