{"我们大半生都活在匪帮天堂里"}
[01:12.027]
[01:12.182]Look at the situation they got me facin'
{"看看他们逼我面对的处境"}
[01:14.740]I can't live a normal life, I was raised by the state
{"无法过正常生活 我是被国家养大的"}
[01:17.959]So I gotta be down with the hood team
{"所以必须忠于街头兄弟"}
[01:20.688]Too much television watchin' got me chasin' dreams
{"电视看太多让我追逐虚妄"}
[01:23.782]I'm a educated fool with money on my mind
{"我是个满脑子钱的受过教育的蠢货"}
[01:26.767]Got my ten in my hand and a gleam in my eye
{"手握十元钞票 眼中闪着寒光"}
[01:29.896]I'm a loc'd out gangsta, set trippin' banger
{"我是彻底疯狂的帮派分子"}
[01:33.040]And my homies is down so don't arouse my anger
{"兄弟们都挺我 别惹我发怒"}
[01:35.915]Fool, death ain't nothin' but a heartbeat away
{"死亡不过是一次心跳的距离"}
[01:38.864]I'm livin' life do or die, what can I say?
{"我过着非生即死的生活 还能说什么？"}
[01:42.225]I'm 23 now, but will I live to see 24?
{"如今我23岁 但能否活到24？"}
[01:44.896]The way things is goin', I don't know
{"照这趋势发展 我真的不知道"}
[01:47.152]
[01:47.562]Tell me why are we so blind to see
{"告诉我为何我们如此盲目"}
[01:53.412]That the ones we hurt are you and me?
{"竟看不见受伤的正是你我？"}
